    "answer": "In 2023, the **Houston TX** distribution center shipped the most net revenue to customers outside its own country (i.e., outside the United States). \n\n**Top Distribution Centers (International Net Revenue in 2023):**\n1. **Houston TX:** $108,279\n2. **Memphis TN:** $86,918\n3. **Chicago IL:** $86,295\n\n*Note: These figures reflect net revenue (excluding cancelled and returned items) based on the date the item was ordered. Since all 10 distribution centers are located in the United States, \"outside its own country\" corresponds to orders shipped to customers with a country other than the US.*"
